{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Elementia, every warrior bends a single element. Command 10 element benders, switch between them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  mid-combat, and master all 10 elements to restore balance in this fast-paced roguelite Action-RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong><i>BEND ALL 10 ELEMENTS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Each hero bends their own element: fire, water, lightning, earth, crystal, wind, shadow, light, metal, and leaf. Build</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   your team, switch benders mid-battle to exploit enemy weaknesses, and become the only one who can bend them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong><i>UNLEASH ULTIMATE FORMS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Push your benders beyond their limits. Each of the 10 heroes transforms into a colossal elemental titan: Divine Angel,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Lava Titan, Storm Beast, and more. Ultimate Forms unleash raw elemental fury that changes the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong><i>CHAIN ELEMENTAL COMBOS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Elements interact. Freeze enemies with your water bender, then switch to earth and shatter them. Trap with leaf, then</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  switch to lightning and shock. Every switch opens a devastating new combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong><i>DIE, LEARN, BEND HARDER</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Each death makes you stronger. Unlock new abilities, upgrade your benders, and discover new elemental synergies. The</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  path through Elementia is unforgiving. A true element bender never stays down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong><i>BEND OR BREAK</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  A full Campaign to conquer, endless hordes to survive, and the mightiest bosses to challenge back to back. Every fight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   demands a different team of benders.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2543660?t=1772296523","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543660/6e1b81cc0d620b70cdc6e829fa5ca9eb5d69cd48/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772296523","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543660/5e0ede21b070dca7a8a0c4711d08cfc788a9c6a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772296523","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543660/5e0ede21b070dca7a8a0c4711d08cfc788a9c6a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772296523","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Elementia, every warrior bends a single element. Command 10 element benders, switch between them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  mid-combat, and master all 10 elements to restore balance in this fast-paced roguelite Action-RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong><i>BEND ALL 10 ELEMENTS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Each hero bends their own element: fire, water, lightning, earth, crystal, wind, shadow, light, metal, and leaf. Build</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   your team, switch benders mid-battle to exploit enemy weaknesses, and become the only one who can bend them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong><i>UNLEASH ULTIMATE FORMS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Push your benders beyond their limits.